    <string name="privacy_body">Daily Astro stores only what it needs: your name, language, sun sign, optional birth date and app settings, linked to a random device ID — no phone number, email or location. Reading history powers your streak and saved list. Horoscope text comes from FreeHoroscopeAPI and is translated automatically; planetary data is calculated from public ephemeris data. You can delete everything at any time from More → Delete my data.</string>
